(6856710, 1032567, 12611, '<td valign="top">Photographically, I think its great Mr. Minso. You kind of have a knave''s haircut mixed with modern tattoos, a modern version of the classic of classics. Good Lighting as well. Very clever, and high marks from me.<br/> <br/>The English Lit. Major in me feels the need to point out that although the question is "to be or not to be," the answer for Hamlet is not "yes or no" the answer to his eventual death, and all of our eventual deaths, is simply, "when."</td>', 'Photographically, I think its great Mr. Minso. You kind of have a knave''s haircut mixed with modern tattoos, a modern version of the classic of classics. Good Lighting as well. Very clever, and high marks from me. The English Lit. Major in me feels the need to point out that although the question is "to be or not to be," the answer for Hamlet is not "yes or no" the answer to his eventual death, and all of our eventual deaths, is simply, "when."', '2012-09-05 09:40:41.000000', NULL, 1),
