(6856782, 1032148, 138253, '<td valign="top">Not happening based on the look of this. She looks oddly placed on the cue ball, which would have the (looks to be the 13 or 14?) going off the bumpers.<br/>if the cue was about an inch or two to Her right it would seem more straight on for this shot.<br/>Mind you, it''s still entirely possible to make this shot where she''s at based on where the contact happens on the cue ball.<br/>Ah pool, what a fantastic way to spend time and over analyze things. :)</td>', 'Not happening based on the look of this. She looks oddly placed on the cue ball, which would have the (looks to be the 13 or 14?) going off the bumpers.if the cue was about an inch or two to Her right it would seem more straight on for this shot.Mind you, it''s still entirely possible to make this shot where she''s at based on where the contact happens on the cue ball.Ah pool, what a fantastic way to spend time and over analyze things. :)', '2012-09-05 11:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
