(6856940, 1032601, 117534, '<td valign="top">(just My opinion) I would''ve liked to seen this in a landscape crop (if it was possible) to show the vast emptyness around th old building. The shot has a very old abandon loney feel, and the diff crop would''ve added to that in my opinion, Your clouds just over the top of the building are the most impressive, so loosig the very top I feel would not have hurt in any way the fell of storm... I''ve taken such a long time to comment on this Because your crop is the way I wouldn''ve cropped it, grabbing as many of the Big clouds as I could.  Then I started listening to others say this very thing and I realized in certain cases less sky and more emptyness was the key... Good luck Nice shot!!</td>', '(just My opinion) I would''ve liked to seen this in a landscape crop (if it was possible) to show the vast emptyness around th old building. The shot has a very old abandon loney feel, and the diff crop would''ve added to that in my opinion, Your clouds just over the top of the building are the most impressive, so loosig the very top I feel would not have hurt in any way the fell of storm... I''ve taken such a long time to comment on this Because your crop is the way I wouldn''ve cropped it, grabbing as many of the Big clouds as I could.  Then I started listening to others say this very thing and I realized in certain cases less sky and more emptyness was the key... Good luck Nice shot!!', '2012-09-05 13:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
