(6857204, 1032539, 77196, '<td valign="top">Answer: Yes<br/>Question: If I take this one, will it fall? <br/> <br/>imo, dof is a bit too shallow - hand is not in focus, neither is Jenga logo. Nice fill the frame top to bottom with the Jenga tower. I also like that the picture does not give you enough information to know whether it will fall or not. I think the picture works - the closeness of his face to the tower, the look of concentration, enough information to communicate the concept (although I know what Jenga is, so maybe that is a bit of a cheat...</td>', 'Answer: YesQuestion: If I take this one, will it fall?  imo, dof is a bit too shallow - hand is not in focus, neither is Jenga logo. Nice fill the frame top to bottom with the Jenga tower. I also like that the picture does not give you enough information to know whether it will fall or not. I think the picture works - the closeness of his face to the tower, the look of concentration, enough information to communicate the concept (although I know what Jenga is, so maybe that is a bit of a cheat...', '2012-09-05 17:09:11.000000', NULL, 1),
