(6858068, 1032148, 77196, '<td valign="top">Answer: Yes<br/>Question: Will it go in? <br/> <br/>I like the perspective on this, as well as the setup. The overhead fluorescent puts a light spot on the wall which allows the leading line to continue through the young lady, and provides a bit of a halo effect on her.</td>', 'Answer: YesQuestion: Will it go in?  I like the perspective on this, as well as the setup. The overhead fluorescent puts a light spot on the wall which allows the leading line to continue through the young lady, and provides a bit of a halo effect on her.', '2012-09-06 10:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6858069, 1032605, 77196, '<td valign="top">Answer: Yes, you can tell by the blue eyes.<br/>Question: Has this image been photoshopped? <br/> <br/>Great image - love the curled lip, face make-up, and badger suit.</td>', 'Answer: Yes, you can tell by the blue eyes.Question: Has this image been photoshopped?  Great image - love the curled lip, face make-up, and badger suit.', '2012-09-06 10:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6858070, 1032174, 77196, '<td valign="top">Answer: Yes, he loves me!<br/>Question: Loves me, or loves me not? <br/> <br/>Very nicely set up photo - love the attention to detail - heart / ring, daisy petals, snail shell, complete daisies (one for each person?). There are minor imperfections in the background, but are not too distracting - the most noticeable is the horizontal line between the two daisies.</td>', 'Answer: Yes, he loves me!Question: Loves me, or loves me not?  Very nicely set up photo - love the attention to detail - heart / ring, daisy petals, snail shell, complete daisies (one for each person?). There are minor imperfections in the background, but are not too distracting - the most noticeable is the horizontal line between the two daisies.', '2012-09-06 10:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6858071, 1032536, 77196, '<td valign="top">Answer: Yes<br/>Question: Do ribbons dance? <br/> <br/>This is a very pleasing abstract. I love the flowing lines through it, and the tones.</td>', 'Answer: YesQuestion: Do ribbons dance?  This is a very pleasing abstract. I love the flowing lines through it, and the tones.', '2012-09-06 10:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(6858073, 1032152, 77196, '<td valign="top">Answer: Yes<br/>Question: Does faith touch lives? <br/> <br/>For me the word that describes this image is "significant" - whatever your opinion about religion, or this particular branch of religion, if you understand the story behind the images, this captures some of that feel.</td>', 'Answer: YesQuestion: Does faith touch lives?  For me the word that describes this image is "significant" - whatever your opinion about religion, or this particular branch of religion, if you understand the story behind the images, this captures some of that feel.', '2012-09-06 10:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6858104, 1032410, 144365, '<td valign="top">#1.<br/>I probably would have left out the claw marks, but you have to lead others fairly strongly or they''ll miss the obvious reference. This was the best idea in the challenge, and to be frank, I''m kind of disappointed I didn''t think of it having a PhD in physics. <br/> <br/>Answering the question we''d have to peek inside, but we''ll only see one of the superpositions.</td>', '#1.I probably would have left out the claw marks, but you have to lead others fairly strongly or they''ll miss the obvious reference. This was the best idea in the challenge, and to be frank, I''m kind of disappointed I didn''t think of it having a PhD in physics.  Answering the question we''d have to peek inside, but we''ll only see one of the superpositions.', '2012-09-06 11:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
