(6860850, 1032567, 129807, '<td valign="top">To be or not to be? <br/>Alas, poor Yorick! I knew him, Horatio:<br/>Can I make mush of any more Shakespeare? Sure I can, but I''ll refrain.<br/>Not sure about this one Joshua. The tones are OK, maybe a bit too dark in places as some shadow detail has been lost. It doesn''t look like you''re looking directly at the skull - I don''t know if you meant this, but it feels a bit disconnected to me. Also, why the shirt off? Is there supposed to be a connection with the tats? If not, maybe shirt on would be better? I do like your composition - that works really well for me.</td>', 'To be or not to be? Alas, poor Yorick! I knew him, Horatio:Can I make mush of any more Shakespeare? Sure I can, but I''ll refrain.Not sure about this one Joshua. The tones are OK, maybe a bit too dark in places as some shadow detail has been lost. It doesn''t look like you''re looking directly at the skull - I don''t know if you meant this, but it feels a bit disconnected to me. Also, why the shirt off? Is there supposed to be a connection with the tats? If not, maybe shirt on would be better? I do like your composition - that works really well for me.', '2012-09-10 01:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
